		PRINTFORMDL You decide to make a simple %M_KOJO_K111_CHILD_TOYNAME(TALENT:111:育児中)% for %CALLNAME:(TALENT:111:育児中)%.
		PRINTFORMDL It's best to make it simple and sturdy, since it's definitely going to get thrown around and bitten up.
		PRINTFORMDW To make sure it won't cause any injury, you carefully sand down any corners and sharp edges.
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「That's right! Let's play with the toy that \@ CHILD_SEX:111:(TALENT:111:育児中 - 1) == 1 ? Big Sisー # Big Broー \@tan usedー!」
		PRINTW 
		PRINTFORMDW After she says that, Clownpiece fetches the %M_KOJO_K111_CHILD_TOYNAME(TALENT:111:育児中 - 1)% that %CHILDNAME:111:(TALENT:111:育児中 - 1)% used to play with.
		PRINTFORMDL You watch the peaceful scene before you――
		PRINTFORMDL [1] - \@ CFLAG:111:(1030 + (TALENT:111:育児中 - 1)) == 1 ? It's deeply moving to see things passed down through the family # Maybe I should make a new doll \@, you think to yourself.
		PRINTFORMDL [2] - \@ CFLAG:111:(1030 + (TALENT:111:育児中 - 1)) == 2 ? It's deeply moving to see things passed down through the family # Maybe I should make a new whistle \@, you think to yourself.
		PRINTFORMDL [3] - \@ CFLAG:111:(1030 + (TALENT:111:育児中 - 1)) == 3 ? It's deeply moving to see things passed down through the family # Maybe I should make a new puzzle \@, you think to yourself.
		INPUT
		IF RESULT == 1
