			PRINTFORML 「Hiyaaー, I'm gonna beat you, with this attackー」
			PRINTW 
			PRINTFORMDW Looks like %HE_SHE_CHILD(111,,TALENT:111:育児中)%'s growing up to be a troublemaker.
		CASE 12
