			PRINTFORMW 「Let's go, eii, eii!」
			PRINTFORML 「Sparkle sparkle, booomー, is it amashing?」
			PRINTW 
			PRINTFORMDW Looks like %HE_SHE_CHILD(111,,TALENT:111:育児中)%'ll be able to shoot Danmaku soon.
		CASEELSE
